    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Experiment 3: TF-IDF + Bigrams + LSA *(Task 1d)*\n",
        "- **Bigrams** capture two-word phrases (e.g. \"not good\" vs \"not\" + \"good\")\n",
        "- **LSA** compresses 20k sparse dimensions → 300 dense dimensions, grouping semantically similar words"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "H6OzlGUfMKyI"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "tfidf_bi = TfidfVectorizer(max_features=20000, sublinear_tf=True, ngram_range=(1, 2))\n",
        "X_bi     = tfidf_bi.fit_transform(train_data.data)\n",
        "X_bi_te  = tfidf_bi.transform(test_data.data)\n",
        "\n",
        "lsa             = TruncatedSVD(n_components=300, random_state=42)\n",
        "X_train_lsa     = lsa.fit_transform(X_bi).astype(np.float32)\n",
        "X_test_lsa      = lsa.transform(X_bi_te).astype(np.float32)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Variance explained by 300 components: {lsa.explained_variance_ratio_.sum():.1%}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "history_lsa, acc_lsa = train_and_evaluate(\n",
        "    X_train_lsa, X_test_lsa, train_data.target, test_data.target,\n",
        "    input_dim=300, run_name=\"tfidf-bigrams-lsa\"\n",
        ")"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 1000
        },
        "id": "96fufhwFMHgU",
